        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>浙江大学报 - 286幅珍贵教学挂图</title>\n<style>\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    color: #222;\n    background: #fff;\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n  }\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #c0392b;\n    padding-bottom: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .page-num {\n    font-size: 36px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #c0392b;\n    margin-right: 15px;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .header-section {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #c0392b;\n    margin-right: 20px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .header-date {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #555;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .header-date .editor {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .header-logo {\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n  .header-logo .cn {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n  }\n  .header-logo .en {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #555;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .main-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 42px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n    margin: 20px 0 25px;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .story-header {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .story-header .num {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 24px;\n    height: 24px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 22px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    margin-left: 4px;\n  }\n  .intro